WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.228 --> 00:00:15.828
We did it!

2
00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:17.850
What an amazing rescue!

3
00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.371
Brad: I'm just glad it's over.

4
00:00:20.391 --> 00:00:23.954
Dave: It feels good to be free again.

5
00:00:23.974 --> 00:00:26.815
Tina: Quick, let's get out of here.

6
00:00:34.736 --> 00:00:36.237
Bello: We should be safe in here.

7
00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:43.061
Chuck: I'm not so sure we're safe.

8
00:00:43.081 --> 00:00:44.461
Dave: Why not?

9
00:00:44.481 --> 00:00:45.902
Chuck: Look at him.

10
00:00:46.823 --> 00:00:47.403
What is he?

11
00:00:47.423 --> 00:00:51.845
Danny: What are you two whispering about?

12
00:00:51.865 --> 00:00:54.447
Dave: We want to know who the monster is!

13
00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:57.108
Brad: He's not a monster.

14
00:00:57.128 --> 00:00:58.669
Danny: Brad's right.

15
00:00:58.689 --> 00:01:03.372
Danny: He's a giant from Ginormous.

16
00:01:04.336 --> 00:01:07.018
Danny: I told you about him, but you didn't believe me!

17
00:01:07.038 --> 00:01:09.639
Chuck: He doesn't look like a giant.

18
00:01:09.659 --> 00:01:11.961
Dave: He looks like a monster.

19
00:01:11.981 --> 00:01:17.084
Danny: Don't be stupid.

20
00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:18.885
Bello is not a freak.

21
00:01:19.706 --> 00:01:21.587
Dave: Who did you call stupid?

22
00:01:23.008 --> 00:01:26.330
Bello: Please, everybody stop.

23
00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:29.472
Danny: I called you stupid, you idiot!

24
00:01:31.148 --> 00:01:35.030
Chuck: Just because you rescued us doesn't mean I can't beat you up!

25
00:01:36.591 --> 00:01:37.772
Brad: Try it!

26
00:01:37.792 --> 00:01:39.873
Dave: Did you say, "Try it"?

27
00:01:39.893 --> 00:01:41.614
Danny: That's what he said.

28
00:01:41.914 --> 00:01:42.474
Try it.

29
00:01:43.715 --> 00:01:52.700
Tina: are you okay?

30
00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.842
Bello: My color is fading.

31
00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:57.843
The boys shouldn't fight.

32
00:01:57.863 --> 00:02:00.064
Bello: It's making me sad.

33
00:02:02.456 --> 00:02:03.877
Chuck: I'll get you for that!

34
00:02:03.897 --> 00:02:05.077
Danny: Ow!

35
00:02:05.337 --> 00:02:06.258
I'll get you back!

36
00:02:06.278 --> 00:02:09.799
Tina: Danny, Brad!

37
00:02:09.859 --> 00:02:12.820
Stop. Look at what you're doing to Bello!

38
00:02:18.963 --> 00:02:24.485
Stop! Chuck: Okay, okay.

39
00:02:24.685 --> 00:02:25.566
We stopped.

40
00:02:25.586 --> 00:02:27.767
Brad: We're sorry, Bello.

41
00:02:27.787 --> 00:02:32.281
Dave: Hey, what happened to his color?

42
00:02:32.301 --> 00:02:35.943
Bello: My color is fading because of your fighting!

43
00:02:35.963 --> 00:02:38.264
Bello: Danny was telling the truth.

44
00:02:39.245 --> 00:02:41.546
I am a giant from the land of Ginormous.

45
00:02:42.406 --> 00:02:49.050
Bello: Danny, Tina, and Brad rescued our world from an evil magician [n3@who was stealing our color.

46
00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:54.693
Bello: Since then, whenever we see evil, it makes our color fade.

47
00:02:55.914 --> 00:02:57.074
Chuck: Whoa.

48
00:02:57.094 --> 00:02:59.836
Danny: We're sorry, Bello.

49
00:02:59.856 --> 00:03:03.753
Bello: My father told me about Tristay's hatred.

50
00:03:03.773 --> 00:03:07.435
Bello: He told me how it almost destroyed everything we loved.

51
00:03:07.455 --> 00:03:10.476
Bello: I will not watch it happen to my friends.

52
00:03:10.496 --> 00:03:14.458
Danny: I can't believe I made you lose your color.

53
00:03:14.478 --> 00:03:17.139
Danny: I can't believe that I hurt you.

54
00:03:17.159 --> 00:03:19.000
Brad: Me too, Bello.

55
00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:28.724
Bello: When we return to normal size, you will see that I am a giant.

56
00:03:29.452 --> 00:03:32.735
Bello: Then I will return to my home, and you will to yours.

57
00:03:32.755 --> 00:03:35.036
Bello: That is our mission now.

58
00:03:35.056 --> 00:03:41.121
Chuck: The hugging was gross, but seeing your color [n3@come back was totally cool.

59
00:03:41.141 --> 00:03:43.963
Tina: Didn't you hear what Bello said?

60
00:03:44.644 --> 00:03:45.565
We have a mission.

61
00:03:45.585 --> 00:03:48.067
Tina: It's time to work together.

62
00:03:48.087 --> 00:03:50.068
Dave: Whatever.

63
00:03:50.468 --> 00:03:51.970
I'm not hugging anybody.
